# merge-libjpeg-turbo-2.0.1
#
# Historically this patch backported libjpeg-turbo 2.0.1 fixes into older
# mozjpeg (Targa colormap bounds, MIPS soft-float SIMD, AVX2 XSAVE detection,
# JDK 11 javah, jconfig.h cmakedefine values, TurboJPEG JNI critical-section
# ordering, etc.).
#
# mozjpeg 4.1.5 already includes all of those changes (it tracks libjpeg-turbo
# well past 2.0.1).  Retained as a packaging no-op so Patch1 still applies;
# there is no remaining source delta against this tree.
#
diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index abcdef0..abcdef0 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
